<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 17.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 17.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Tunisian leader calls for ending trade sanctions on Iraq.</p>
<p>- National Assembly ratifies a contract with China to develop an Iraqi oilfield.</p>
<p>QADISSIYA</p>
<p>- Work is still in progress to repair facilities of Umm Qasr port in the Gulf mouth.</p>
</text>
